Container packaging replaces the AppImage's private expat, lzma, mspack and
zlib shared libraries with Ubuntu 24.04 packages. The executable, launcher
and profiles are unchanged. The installed package versions are recorded in
/usr/share/doc/orca-server/system-packages.txt; package copyright and license
texts remain under /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright.

OrcaSlicer and dependency copyright/license/notice files are preserved under
/usr/share/doc/orcaslicer/notices, and its library credits are retained in
/usr/share/doc/orcaslicer/AboutDialog.cpp. Source archives, dependency
versions, patches and build instructions are available without charge in
the matching OrcaServer release's OrcaSlicer-2.4.2-sources.tar.gz asset:
https://github.com/miyabi-sunny-side/orca-server/releases
The dependency archive checksums and URLs are also in
/usr/share/doc/orcaslicer/slicer-sources.txt.
wxWidgets uses commit db1005db3dea2c37a46fb455a9a02e37aa360751
(the v3.3.2 branch at the AppImage release date) with its recorded submodules.
Each source retains its own copyright, license and build instructions.

OrcaServer's Rust dependency licenses and notices are preserved under
/usr/share/doc/orca-server/dependencies. The matching release includes their
Cargo.lock-pinned sources in OrcaServer-dependencies.tar.gz, with Cargo's
vendor configuration for rebuilding. The web bundle includes Svelte,
esm-env, clsx and normalize.css; their MIT notices are retained under
/usr/share/doc/orca-server/frontend. Exact package versions are in the
OrcaServer source's client/package-lock.json.

